#: includes/widgets/class-continuous-slider.php:293
msgid "Decimals (e.g. 2.5) let the next slide peek in. Left empty, the strip shows 7 slides, 5 below 1300 px and 4 below 1100 px, like the original."
msgstr "Dezimalwerte (z. B. 2.5) lassen die nächste Slide angeschnitten hereinragen. Leer gelassen zeigt der Streifen 7 Slides, unter 1300 px 5 und unter 1100 px 4, wie das Original."

#: includes/widgets/class-continuous-slider.php:303
#: includes/widgets/class-posts.php:657
msgid "Gap"
msgstr "Abstand"

#: includes/widgets/class-continuous-slider.php:325
